# Lazav, Wearer of Faces: "exile target card from a graveyard, then investigate". With its one target gone the ability does
# nothing (CR 608.2b), so no Clue is made. Bot1 targets its Ornithopter; in response Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles Bot1's graveyard.
